---
import Layout from '~/layouts/PageLayout.astro';

const metadata = {
  title: 'Malaysia Food Tour Destinations — Food Culture & Heritage',
  description: 'Explore Malaysia through its food culture and heritage. Kuala Lumpur, Penang, Ipoh, Cameron Highlands, Melaka, Johor — each with its own food story.',
};
---

<Layout metadata={metadata}>
  <section class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <span class="text-accent font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase text-sm">Places</span>
      <h1 class="mt-2 text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold font-heading">Destinations We Operate In</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-lg text-muted max-w-3xl">Each destination has its own food culture, shaped by history, community, and tradition. We work with local producers and cooks who keep these traditions alive.</p>
      <div class="mt-10 grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading">Kuala Lumpur</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Street food from three cultures, wet markets that have operated for generations, family-run hawker stalls, and the communities that keep traditional food alive in a modern city.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading">Penang</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">George Town's heritage food scene, Nyonya home cooking passed down through families, fishing villages using traditional methods, and family-owned durian orchards practicing sustainable farming.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading">Ipoh</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">White coffee from original Hainanese coffee shops, bean sprout chicken from farms using traditional methods, Hakka cuisine preserved by the community for over a century.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading">Cameron Highlands</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Family-run tea plantations, small-scale strawberry farms, steamboat dinners using locally grown vegetables, and the indigenous Orang Asli food traditions of the highlands.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading">Melaka</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Baba Nyonya heritage cuisine — one of the world's first fusion food cultures, Portuguese Eurasian dishes preserved for 500 years, and Jonker Street's traditional food vendors.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-white border border-brand-100 p-6 rounded-xl">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-heading">Johor Bahru</h2>
          <p class="mt-2 text-muted">Laksa Johor made with traditional spice pastes, murtabak from families who have been making them for generations, and the unique food culture of Malaysia's southern gateway.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
